[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0010","text":"现在的心情……果然还是香草味吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0020","text":"（咦……土是干的……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0030","text":"（今天太阳好大嘛……\n　等一下哦……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0035","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0036","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0040","text":"啊，制作人\n辛苦了～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0050","text":"辛苦了\n你帮我浇了水吗。谢谢啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0060","text":"──话说……\n桌上的冰淇淋，是甘奈的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0070","text":"啊……！　忘了……！\n都化掉了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0080","text":"光想着得赶紧给这孩子浇水……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0090","text":"其实我正好刚买了一批冰淇淋回来\n不嫌弃的话吃这个吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400600_01_0100","text":"诶嘿嘿……嗯！"}]
